          </div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What's the most common bank statement mistake?</summary>
          <div class="msv__faq-answer">
            <p>Submitting statements that don't clearly show income source or amount. Unclear transaction descriptions, statements without your name printed, or inconsistent deposit patterns are red flags.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do I need to highlight income deposits on my bank statements?</summary>
          <div class="msv__faq-answer">
